        19
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hart%2C_Texas"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Hart became an organized town in 1925 when the Fort Worth and Denver South Plains Railway announced a depot there.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        20
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hart%2C_Texas"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The depot’s construction led to Hart’s incorporation, formalizing its municipal status.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
